	"data": "Concept: Star System — XR Operating System\n\nWhat It Is\nA web-based XR operating system that treats reality as the interface. One central powerhouse computer handles all GPU/CPU; devices (phones, VR, AR glasses) are thin clients streaming view and input. Built on decentralized Web 3.0 / Solid Pod architecture.\n\nThe macro vision that everything else plugs into.\n\nKey Components\nScenes — surrounding environments (Unity worlds, digital twins, God Mode)\nThemes / Mirror Worlds — aesthetic filters over…",
